    "notes": "Inspected 71 current frames: 13 portable, 13 dated shared-material/geographic, 25 medium-fi and 20 native. The intact Ava exterior retains nine principal pale polygonal truss bays with open vertical/diagonal webs, top crossframes, flanged members/gussets, central rails/sleepers, outside narrow road decks and walks, red masonry pier shafts, pale chamfered footings and short approach supports. Corrected inward deck winding and buried bank edges during this same authoring pass. Far levels retain the principal silhouette and simplify web/rail detail. Automatic end-on turntables are necessarily narrow for this 1.2 km asset; the explicit side, pier, deck and bank cameras provide the usable detail evidence."
